          "capabilities": [
            "auth-auth0"
          ],
          "containers": [
            "keycloak"
          ],
          "migrations": false,
          "integration-suite": false,
          "label": "Auth0 \u2014 an application, an API and the staff roles, provisioned through Auth0's own Management API rather than by the cloud, with a post-login action putting the roles in a namespaced claim; Keycloak runs locally as the stand-in, with the same groups and OIDC_* keys (the flow itself is NOT implemented)",
